@title Digital Support Summary
@subtitle January to September 2026
@author Customer Support (digital channels), Gullwing Airlines

kpi Tickets | 18,420 | September
kpi Median first response | 2.4 h | September
kpi CSAT | 4.3 / 5 | September
kpi Self-service deflection | 37% | September

# Ticket volume
data vol = month,tickets; Jan,15210; Feb,14380; Mar,16950; Apr,17210; May,16480; Jun,21740; Jul,23960; Aug,20110; Sep,18420; Oct,17260
chart line vol title="Tickets per month"

# Tickets by category
data cat = category,tickets; Refunds,5130; Booking changes,4470; Baggage,3260; Loyalty points,2410; App login,1840; Other,1310
chart hbar cat labels title="September tickets by category"

# CSAT by channel
table = Channel,Tickets,Median first response (h),CSAT; Chat,"8,920",0.3,4.5; Email,"6,140",**6.8**,**3.9**; Phone callback,"2,210",1.1,4.4; Social,"1,150",3.2,4.0; WhatsApp,940,0.5,4.6

# Notes
- The June and July spike came from the summer schedule changes.
- The new refund self-service form launched on 2026-08-12.
- Email response times remain the weakest point.

!! Refunds are still the largest category, at 5,130 tickets in September, despite the new form.
